<title>UK: Hewlett-Packard sets 250 mln mark Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard sets 250 mln mark Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HEWLETT-PACKARD FINANCE CO</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
